1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,200
Jump into a hole

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:01,960
through the Earth,

3
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,080
and you'd pop out

4
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,516
in 38 minutes.

5
00:00:05,716 --> 00:00:06,927
The hole would be about

6
00:00:06,927 --> 00:00:09,680
12,700 km long.

7
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:11,500
The deepest hole

8
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,605
anyone has dug?

9
00:00:12,605 --> 00:00:14,400
12 km.

10
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,378
About 0.1% of the way.

11
00:00:17,478 --> 00:00:18,820
So let's pretend.

12
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:19,460
No air,

13
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,180
no lava,

14
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,241
no spinning Earth.

15
00:00:22,241 --> 00:00:23,100
You jump.

16
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,420
Gravity pulls you down,

17
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,654
faster and faster.

18
00:00:26,654 --> 00:00:27,820
By the center,

19
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:28,620
you're doing more than

20
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,177
8 km a second.

21
00:00:31,177 --> 00:00:32,560
Then gravity flips.

22
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:33,880
Now it's behind you,

23
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:34,868
slowing you down.

24
00:00:35,868 --> 00:00:37,260
You rise up the other side

25
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,200
and stop,

26
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,241
right at the top.

27
00:00:40,141 --> 00:00:41,220
Grab the edge.

28
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:41,760
Miss it,

29
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,200
and you fall all the way back.

30
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,448
And back again.

31
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:46,280
Textbooks say

32
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,440
the trip takes 42 minutes.

33
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,620
But that assumes Earth

34
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,120
is the same density

35
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,453
all the way through.

36
00:00:53,453 --> 00:00:54,240
It isn't.

37
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,920
The crust is about 3 grams

38
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:57,680
per cubic centimeter.

39
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:58,200
The center,

40
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,564
about 13.

41
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:01,260
Redo the sum

42
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,300
with the real Earth,

43
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:03,700
measured by earthquakes,

44
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,852
and you get 38 minutes.

45
00:01:06,952 --> 00:01:08,040
Weirder still:

46
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:08,860
pretend gravity

47
00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:10,960
never changes on the way down.

48
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:11,760
You get almost

49
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:12,874
the same answer.

50
00:01:13,974 --> 00:01:15,220
38 minutes.

51
00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:16,144
Door to door.

